  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Aroni nindi, Nineyi nianyaneyi amayala niivumu dawankakulula jeyi hamu neyi, mwakasendaŋa kuluwa kwamalala. Nineyi nianyaneyi amayala hamu neyi, mwakasendaŋa kuluwa kwawupristuwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niana kweyi nawa, wowu muchidi waLe vi, muchidi wankakululayeyi, wuwushikiji kwakwihi hamu naneyi, kulonda akayibombi naneyi, akakukalakelaŋa. Ilaŋa eyi nianyaneyi hamu mwakekalaŋa kiunesu etentidawunsahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatalaŋa mudimu weyi, nimudimu wetenti dejima. Bayidinu akadata kwakwihi nayuma yamalala hela nakameŋaku, akenza kafwaniwena nineyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayibombi naneyi, akatalaŋa itenti dakubulakena nakukalakala mudimu wetenti dejima. Mwenyi kudata kwakwihi nanenunehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu yenu mwakatalaŋa mudimu wamalala, nimudimu wakameŋa, kuchina anyana kaIsarela akenza kamona cheŋi ndombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami, tiyenu, ami nayifumishi dehi ana kwenu aLevi mukachi kawanyana kaIsarela; anekali dehi chamukunkulu chenu chakwinka Yehova, kulonda akakalakalaŋa mudimu wetenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nineyi nianyaneyi hamu neyi mwakatalaŋa wupristu wenu wayuma yakameŋa yejima, niwayuma yidi mukachikehina dakujika hakachi, diyi mwakakalakalaŋa. Nayinki dehi wupristuwenu himudimu wawana. Mwenyi wakadataku akamujahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naAroni, nindi, Ami, tiyenu, ami nayinki dehi kutalanyilambu yami yakuleleka, yoyuma yejima yakujilikawu anyana kaIsarela, nakwinkiyi nanochu chakuwayishawu manji, nenki nianyaneyi amayala, yenu yachidika chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya yiwakadyaŋa hayuma yaswejakujila yahakesi; yanyilambu yawu yejima, nyilambu yawu yawuŋa yejima, ninyilambu yawu yahanshidi yejima, ninyilambu yawu yakutanya yejima, yakuletelawu ami, yakekalaŋa yajila nankashi yeyeyi nawanyaneyi amayala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayidyaŋa neyi chiwadyaŋa yuma yasweja kujila. Akayidyaŋa kudi amayala ejima. Yakekalaŋa yeyi yajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya yiwakadyaŋa; himulambu wakuleleka wachamukunkulu chawu yonyilambu yakunyinkesha yejima yawanyana kaIsarela. Nakwinkiyu yeyi nawanyaneyi amayala nawanyaneyi iawambanda, yalushimbi lwahaya nyaka. Antu akumutaŋa weyi atooka ejima akadyaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimanji asweja kuwaha ejima, nivinyu yayiha yaswejakuwaha yejima, nitidiku yasweja kuwaha yejima, yoyuma yakahila yenkaŋa wuYehova, nakwinkiyu yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbutu yakahila yejima yamwituŋa dawu iyamuletelaŋawu Yehova yakekalaŋa yeyi. Antu akumutaŋa weyi atooka ejima akadyaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yamu Isarela yajilikawu yejima yakekalaŋa yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejima asambilaŋa kuvwalika alambulaŋawu Yehova, hela awantu, hela lawanyama, akekalaŋa eyi; ilaŋa wedi wamuntu chiŋa wakamukúula, niwediwakanyama wamajilu wakamukúula niyena nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa akakúulawu akufumisha mukakweji kamu wakayikuula, mwomu mundandu yawuwakayesekela mali jishekeli jitanu mwomu mulushekeli lwakumalala, hijingera makumi ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila wedi waŋombi, hela wedi wamukoku, hela wedi wampembi, kuyikúula nehi; ajila; mashi awu wakayisampula hakameŋa, manji awu wakayishitaŋa bwi-i, hihimulambu wakwila nakesiwaku mununkishila Yehova ivumba dadiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbŋi yawu yakekalaŋayeyi neyi chikwebwambu dakunyinkesha nimwendu wachidiilu, yakekalaŋayeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyilambu yakuleleka yejima yayuma yajila, yahimulambu laŋawu Yehova kudi anyana kaIsarela, nakwinki yeyi nawanyaneyi amayala nawanyaneyi awambanda hamu naneyi, yachidika chahaya nyaka; hichitiyaŋenu chamuŋwa chahaya nyaka kumesu aYehova, cheyi nawanyaneyi hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Aroni, nindi, Bayi wakaheta wuswana mwituŋa dawuku, hela kuheta iseka mukachi kawu nehi; iseka deyi yami, wuswana weyi yami, mukachi kawanyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila anyana kaLevi nayinki yamwikumi yamuIsarela yiikali wuswana wawu, nanyidimu yawu yakunkoŋelawu, yonyidimu yetenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha hanu anyana kaIsarela bayi akenzaŋa kwakwihinetenti dakubulakenaku, akenza kakoola nshidi hiyakafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Levi diwu akukoŋaŋa mudimu wetenti dakubulakena, diwu akusendaŋakuluwa kwawu; chakekalaŋa chidika chahaya nyaka kumakiŋu ejima amba kavwalikilaŋawu antu, hiyamba kahetaŋa wuswana mukachi kawanyana kaIsarelaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yamwikumi yawanyana kaIsarela, yahimulambu laŋawu Yehova yahimulambu wakuleleka, nayinki dehi aLevi yakekalaŋa wuswana wawu. Dichi chinayila dehi nami, akabulaŋa kuheta wuswanamukachi kawanyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nawaLevi, wakayilineyi, Chimwaka tambulaŋa kudi anyana kaIsarela yamwikumi yinayinki dehi yakudi wena yawuswana wenu, himwakalambulamu himulambu wakulelekawa Yehova yamwikumi yayamwikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulambu wenu wakuleleka akayifuukwilawu neyi tidiku yahawuhulilu, hela neyi vinyu yinavuli kuwukamwinuwavinyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi mwakahimulambu laŋa Yehova himulambu wakuleleka, wayuma yenu yamwikumi yejima yimukutambulaŋa kudi anyana kaIsarela; wakanonaŋamu himulambu waYehova wakuleleka, mwakamwinkaŋa wukapristu Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayamukunkulu yenu yejima mwakanonahu, mwakalambuli nyilambu yaYehova yakuleleka yejima, yoyuma yasweja mukuwaha yejima, yoyuma yekalamu yakujilika dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
