              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wakayili neyi, Chimwakaleleka yaswejamu kuwaha akayifuukwila aLevi neyi yinavuli dehi yahawuhulilu, niyinavuli dehi yahawukamwinu wavinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
