              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadya ŋakwoku munadiili kwoku, ninenu niakwamatalenu; hiwufwetu wenu nanyidimuyenu yimwakoŋaŋa mwitenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
